	(text "Label: 'HAZARDOUS VOLTAGE - up to 1000 V DC to earth - isolated debug probe only'. TMS 2.2k pull-up\n(no TRSTn on F28003x, table 5-1); TRST (2) open; EMU0/1 4.7k pull-ups; RESET (15) on XRSn; 17-19 GND.\nField firmware update over CAN (DCAN boot option 1 or application loader): no live access needed."
